<title>JAPAN: Hokuriku Seiyaku - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokuriku Seiyaku - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.75		vs	    7.80</p>
<p> Operating	  389 million	 vs	  356 million</p>
<p> Current	    514 million	 vs	  515 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 168 million	 vs	prft 159 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.43 yen	  vs     prft 3.25 yen</p>
<p> Shares		49 million	 vs	   49 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokuriku Seiyaku Co Ltd is a pharmaceutical maker.</p>
</text>
